</div>
<div id="u-credit-00220-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-hormress" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4142571); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4142571&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609123010" alt="Dr Hormress" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4142571)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-hormress" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4142571); return false;">Dr Hormress</a></span></p>
